<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĕhŏ</span></b> , interj.; in the comic
		poets, used in asking, commanding, or scolding, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>ha? ho! holla! soho!</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In vehement questions,
				<i><span class="en">Plaut. Ep. 3, 4, 69</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 2,
			22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Bacch. 4, 7, 5</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eho tu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Merc. 1, 2, 77</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ter. And. 5, 4, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Eun. 4,
				4, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Phorm. 2, 3,
			35</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			In impetuous commands, Plaut.  Most. 3, 2, 157;
					<i><span class="en">id. Men. 2, 3, 78</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. Ps. 1, 3, 114</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. Ad. 5,
				9, 13</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eho puer,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Hec. 4, 4, 97</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b> In
			angry remonstrance or invective, <i><span class="en">Plaut.
				Bacch. 3, 3, 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Mil. 3,
				2, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Pers. 3, 3, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. And.
				4, 2, 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Phorm. 4, 4,
			3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			With affixed <i>dum</i>, <i><span class="en">Ter. And.
				1, 2, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 5, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 1, 24</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">id.
				Eun. 2, 3, 69</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
